flowchart LR
  Operator[Scoped deploy identity] --> Gate[Candidate and approval gate]
  Gate --> Releases[Versioned release directory]
  Releases --> Active[Atomic active pointer]
  Active --> Services[Systemd services]
  Secrets[Root-owned runtime secrets] --> Services
  Data[(External SQLite data)] --> Services
  Backup[Verified checkpoint] --> Data
  Previous[Previous verified release] --> Active
  HostKey[Pinned host identity] --> Gate
